  "Worldwide, buyers who cut paid Russia {less} less for goods and fuel; others paid {more} more (net {net}, counted at Russia's net gain).": "Wereldwijd betaalden kopers die minderden Rusland {less} minder voor goederen en brandstof; anderen betaalden {more} meer (netto {net}, gerekend tegen de nettowinst van Rusland).",
  "Net: support plus the change in payments": "Netto: steun plus verandering in betalingen",
